{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>無綫電視59周年台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》於11月9日首播，馬國明與陳豪在劇中為了陳自瑤上演激烈三角關係。最新劇情揭露馬國明搶先與女方發生關係，令原本準備求婚的陳豪大受打擊。隨着怒掉求婚戒指一幕播出，這段兄弟爭女風波正式掀起一場殘酷暗戰。</p>\n<h2>陳豪求婚前驚悉馬國明捷足先登</h2>\n<p>在本週播出的《玫瑰戰爭》劇情中，陳豪飾演天誠娛樂老闆陳雲生，原本滿心歡喜準備向影后關子盈求婚，卻意外得知同母異父弟弟李德龍早已搶先一步與女方發生關係。陳雲生大受打擊，由偏遠複式豪宅獨自徒步走到旺角行人天橋，更憤然將求婚戒指掟走。陳雲生在天橋上的落寞身影成為該集焦點所在。</p>\n<h2>監製拆解陳豪馬國明兄弟身份之謎</h2>\n<p>由於陳豪角色名為陳雲生，而馬國明角色名為李德龍，不少觀眾對兩人同母異父兄弟設定感到疑惑。劇集監製對此作出公開解釋，指出兩個名字其實皆為娛樂圈藝名，情況等同於秦沛與姜大衛這對現實中不同姓氏兄弟一樣。監製亦表明這項細節安排是為了突顯劇中人物背景。</p>\n<h2>劇集改編網絡小說結局設定震撼</h2>\n<p>這次劇集改編自吳沚默創作網絡小說《維多利亞的派對》，不過電視版本在人物設定上作出大幅度修改。在原著故事中馬國明角色設定為姚子羚表弟，並且愛上楊茜堯最終更慘遭女方毒手。根據原著第27章結局描述情節走向極度暗黑，陳豪飾演角色因涉及4屍命案被判終身監禁，而楊茜堯角色最後更親手放火燒死馬國明角色，未知劇集最終會否完全跟隨這個震撼結局。</p>\n<h2>觀眾猜測馬國明陳自瑤命運走向</h2>\n<p>隨著錯綜複雜兄弟爭女情節播出，大批觀眾在網上熱烈討論劇情發展。有網民留言表示「陳豪掉戒指嗰幕真係好心酸」，認為他因愛成恨絕對有充分動機對陳自瑤痛下殺手。同時也有觀眾對於劇集改動原著設定感到驚喜，紛紛留下「估唔到馬國明同陳豪係兄弟」、「強強對決真係好有火花」等評論，大眾對於這場牽涉多條人命娛樂圈恩怨情仇抱有極高期待，急不及待想揭開終極謎團。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455376319384178_4018110546af6b7a3c913b.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1113-7.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455376319384178_4018110546af6b7a3c913b.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪在劇中飾演娛樂公司老闆陳雲生，原本打算向心愛的關子盈求婚，結果卻發現自己早已被親弟弟捷足先登。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455376904916408_10395173336af6b7a96e3ef.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1113-8.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455376904916408_10395173336af6b7a96e3ef.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪得悉殘酷真相後神情凝重，內心百般滋味在心頭。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455377559011745_11987804096af6b7b067694.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1113-4.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455377559011745_11987804096af6b7b067694.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>馬國明原來是陳豪的親弟弟，兩人卻同時愛上陳自瑤飾演的關子盈。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455378453376750_17571686126af6b7b9049c2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1113-2.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455378453376750_17571686126af6b7b9049c2.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪在天橋上神情沉重（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455379210849905_16400665476af6b7c1043be.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1113-6.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455379210849905_16400665476af6b7c1043be.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪早已準備好鑽石戒指（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455380818422568_634161276af6b7d0a166d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1113-10.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455380818422568_634161276af6b7d0a166d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪最終狠心將求婚戒指掟走（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455381772682212_19397738586af6b7da38e61.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--05-DramasQ-22’41”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455381772682212_19397738586af6b7da38e61.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>馬國明搶先與陳自瑤發展感情（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455382017617403_17798969296af6b7dc99116.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--05-DramasQ-2’40”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455382017617403_17798969296af6b7dc99116.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪原本打算向心愛的關子盈求婚。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:21:15.285401+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1238,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:00:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:43.671153+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:43.671153+00:00","content_hash":"5a60d40fc167b39da1a96ad78d504d34c7128db0317166553f73a0dc068b0242","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}